							<span><b>01. General Questions</b></span><br /><ul><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=48">Do I need to be a programmer to use GuildPortal?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=47">How long has GuildPortal been around?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=50">We have a programmer in the guild.  Why would we use GuildPortal?</a></li><br /></ul><br /><span><b>02. Characters and Profiles</b></span><br /><ul><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=54">How do I change my password?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=53">How do I change/set my time zone settings?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=49">How do I delete one of my characters?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=55">How do I set up my signature?</a></li><br /></ul><br /><span><b>03. Site Administration</b></span><br /><ul><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=28">How do I allow users to manage content?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=26">How do I change colors and manage content for my site?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=58">How do I change the Forum Icons?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=57">How do I change the Tab Images</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=46">How do I get my guild in the Spotlight?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=22">How do I get the word out about our new site?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=25">How do I tell people where our site is?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=56">How do I upload images to my site? </a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=23">How do people sign up to join my site?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=16">I paid for a guild, and I want it deleted.</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=27">The link to the Control Panel doesn't appear for me.</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=52">What is the Idle Monitor, and how do I use it?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=21">Where's a good place to go to learn about using the administrative tools?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=29">Will GuildPortal host my Domain Name?</a></li><br /></ul><br /><span><b>04. Subscriptions</b></span><br /><ul><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=17">Can I subscribe, and then immediately cancel, to avoid recurring charges?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=51">How do I cancel my subscription?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=20">How to I allow members to donate to the site?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=14">I didn't cancel my subscription via PayPal, but I haven't used the site in months.  Can the charge be refunded?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=13">I no longer play the game, and haven't for months.  Why am I being charged?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=12">I was just billed again for the services after 6 months.  What's this about?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=18">What happens when my subscription is cancelled and runs out?  Is my content lost?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=37">What is PayPal, and why does GuildPortal use it?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=19">Will you put up a "non-payment" screen if I cancel to avoid recurring payments between the time the site goes non-subscriber and when I re-subscribe?</a></li><br /></ul><br /><span><b>05. Content : Forums</b></span><br /><ul><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=35">How do I get notifications of activity for topics I'm interested in?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=36">I subscribed to a topic, but I'm not getting notifications in my e-mail.  Why?</a></li><br /></ul><br /><span><b>06. Content : Rosters</b></span><br /><ul><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=30">A character doesn't appear on the roster.  Why?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=31">I am a guild leader.  Can I enter my member's data to the roster myself?</a></li><br /></ul><br /><span><b>07. Advanced Administration</b></span><br /><ul><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=34">Can I run my PHP, ASP, or CGI scripts on GuildPortal?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=32">How do I create a theme that other administrators can use?</a></li><br /></ul><br /><span><b>08. Technology</b></span><br /><ul><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=38">10a. What's behind the scenes?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=39">10b. Is the CSE built off another code base?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=40">10c. Will you make the CSE open source?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=41">10d. Can my company purchase the source code?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=43">10e. Who hosts the servers?</a></li><br /></ul><br /><span><b>09. People</b></span><br /><ul><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=45">Are there plans to go public?</a></li><br /><li><a href="FAQ.aspx?FAQEntry=42">Who runs GuildPortal?</a></li><br /></ul><br />
							
